---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// DQN in one picture (Mnih et al. 2015): experience replay + a frozen target network.
// Worked target: reward 1, gamma 0.9, best target-network value of next state 3 -> y = 1 + 0.9*3 = 3.7.
const W = 900;
const H = 400;
---
<figure class="p19-dqn">
  <div class="p19-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="DQN training loop. Experience from the market is stored in a replay buffer. Random mini-batches are drawn from it. The online network predicts Q for the chosen action. A frozen copy, the target network, computes the target: reward plus gamma times its best next value. The difference between the two is the loss. The target network is refreshed from the online network every C steps. Worked example: 1 plus 0.9 times 3 equals 3.7.">
      <text x="30" y="28" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Deep Q-network: two tricks that keep training from chasing itself</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Deep Q-network: hai mẹo để việc học không tự đuổi theo cái đuôi của mình</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="70" width="170" height="100" rx="10" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={115} y={98} size={24} />
      <text x="115" y="136" text-anchor="middle" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Market</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thị trường</tspan></text>
      <text x="115" y="154" text-anchor="middle" class="s">(s, a, r, s′)</text>

      <line x1="200" y1="120" x2="262" y2="120" class="arrow fm-flow" /><polygon points="272,120 260,114 260,126" class="head" />

      <rect x="272" y="70" width="190" height="100" rx="10" class="box hot" />
      <DiagramIcon name="db" x={367} y={98} size={24} />
      <text x="367" y="136" text-anchor="middle" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Replay buffer</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bộ nhớ replay</tspan></text>
      <text x="367" y="154" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>old steps, shuffled</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bước cũ, xáo trộn</tspan></text>

      <line x1="462" y1="120" x2="524" y2="120" class="arrow" /><polygon points="534,120 522,114 522,126" class="head" />
      <text x="498" y="106" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>batch</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>batch</tspan></text>

      <rect x="534" y="40" width="336" height="76" rx="10" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="model" x={566} y={78} size={24} />
      <text x="594" y="72" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Online network Q(s,a; θ)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mạng online Q(s,a; θ)</tspan></text>
      <text x="594" y="92" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>trained every step</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>được huấn luyện mỗi bước</tspan></text>

      <rect x="534" y="150" width="336" height="76" rx="10" class="box frozen" />
      <DiagramIcon name="lock" x={566} y={188} size={24} />
      <text x="594" y="182" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Target network Q(s,a; θ⁻)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mạng target Q(s,a; θ⁻)</tspan></text>
      <text x="594" y="202" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>frozen copy, refreshed every C steps</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bản sao đóng băng, làm mới mỗi C bước</tspan></text>

      <line x1="702" y1="116" x2="702" y2="150" class="arrow dash" />
      <text x="712" y="137" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>copy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sao chép</tspan></text>

      <rect x="30" y="262" width="840" height="116" rx="10" class="note" />
      <text x="46" y="288" class="s2"><tspan data-lang-en>target  y = r + γ × max Q(s′, a′; θ⁻)       loss  (y − Q(s, a; θ))²</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mục tiêu  y = r + γ × max Q(s′, a′; θ⁻)       loss  (y − Q(s, a; θ))²</tspan></text>
      <text x="46" y="314" class="s2"><tspan data-lang-en>Say r = 1, γ = 0.9, and the frozen network rates the best next action 3.  Then y = 1 + 0.9 × 3 = 3.7.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giả sử r = 1, γ = 0,9, và mạng đóng băng chấm hành động tiếp theo tốt nhất là 3.  Khi đó y = 1 + 0,9 × 3 = 3,7.</tspan></text>
      <text x="46" y="342" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Replay breaks the link between neighbouring days. The frozen target stops the goalpost from moving on every update.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Replay cắt mối liên hệ giữa các ngày liền kề. Target đóng băng khiến khung thành không dịch chuyển sau mỗi lần cập nhật.</tspan></text>
      <text x="46" y="362" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>On markets, replay also mixes regimes: a batch can hold 2020 and 2023 days side by side.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Trên thị trường, replay còn trộn các regime: một batch có thể chứa ngày của 2020 lẫn 2023.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>DQN was shown on seven Atari games from raw pixels in 2013, then on 49 games in the 2015 Nature paper. The same two ideas carry over to a price feed.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>DQN được trình bày trên bảy game Atari từ pixel thô năm 2013, rồi trên 49 game trong bài Nature 2015. Hai ý tưởng đó mang sang chuỗi giá được nguyên vẹn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p19-dqn { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p19-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p19-dqn svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .p19-dqn text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p19-dqn .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-dqn .t { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-dqn .s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p19-dqn .s2 { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .p19-dqn .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .p19-dqn .box.hot { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .p19-dqn .box.frozen { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .p19-dqn .note { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p19-dqn .arrow { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 2; }
  .p19-dqn .arrow.dash { stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .p19-dqn .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p19-dqn figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
